     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><p style=\"clear:both\">Dear team,<br></p><div>I developed a shiny app and it works locally but does not work after deploying. It uses the package d3Network (<a href=\"http://christophergandrud.github.io/d3Network/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://christophergandrud.github.io/d3Network/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792400642991000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17INg8qV2G2fOfNd6aA8_l\">christophergandrud.github.io/d3Network/</a>) to display a diagram.</div><div><br></div><div>To recheck I cloned the shiny example (<a href=\"https://github.com/christophergandrud/d3ShinyExample\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/christophergandrud/d3ShinyExample&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792400642991000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36ntBBUPuQ4yeTlVxMbSt6\">https://github.com/christophergandrud/d3ShinyExample</a>) and deployed it to <a href=\"http://sachinsancheti.shinyapps.io/d3ShinyExample-byChris\" style=\"color:rgb(91,144,191);box-sizing:border-box;font-family:&#39;Open Sans&#39;,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:19.999979019165px;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-repeat:initial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sachinsancheti.shinyapps.io/d3ShinyExample-byChris&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792400642991000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-GaI7F5el0btUqj4yddJW\">http://sachinsancheti.shinyapps.io/d3ShinyExample-byChris</a> but with the same results.</div><div><b>Local on RStudio:</b></div><p style=\"clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-SOlblBiikkk/VL_x3LalBtI/AAAAAAAACBo/NXDBNNNo4u0/s1600/local.png\" style=\"margin-right:1em;margin-left:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.co